+
+**Found by CI (runs 41352472933 and 41363091264, Windows `headless release` over its 55-minute limit):** the first
+version of the `Rollback` agent snapshot copied the whole hub, activity log included, on every call before dropping
+the log. That made the 10 000-operation MCP history oracles quadratic (`c21_history` 88 s → 501 s,
+`c14_r3_history_*` 45 s → 417 s). The snapshot now copies only the fields it restores; `c14_r3_history_r1` takes 20 s
+locally in release.
